        "kind": "intent_a",
        "rationale": "Change A lets a retry_base be combined with a plain callable using | and &. This test runs those compositions in the AsyncRetrying async-for loop that change B extends. It uses plain `with` so it does not depend on B. On trees without A, `retry_base | fn` raises AttributeError because `other.__ror__` is missing."
